A string whose plain form would reload as a mapping is written single-quoted, so it
round-trips as the string it was.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md summary='a: b'
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
 status: backlog
+summary: 'a: b'
 ---
 # My Plan
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: summary=a: b
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
summary: 'a: b'
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
